# GraphDiya

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphDiya } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphDiya
  title="example"
  animated={true}
  cols={60}
/>
```

<div class="live">
<GraphDiya
  title="example"
  animated={true}
  cols={60}
/>
</div>

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | Caption drawn on the top edge as `[ TITLE ]`. Uppercase, 1–2 words. |
| `animated?` | `boolean` | `true` | Animate the lighting and the breathing. Default true. Reduced motion freezes a fully lit row. |
| `cols?` | `number` | `60` | Width of the scene in characters. Default 60. |
| `rows?` | `number` | `14` | Height of the scene in rows. Default 14. |
| `lamps?` | `number` | `5` | Number of diyas in the row. Default 5. |
| `speedMs?` | `number` | `110` | Milliseconds per tick. Default 110. |
| `seedNum?` | `number` | `13` | Seed for the per-lamp phase and gutter schedule. Default 13. |
| `label?` | `string` | `'row of light'` | Short caption under the art; the art itself is decorative. |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `GraphDiyaProps`

## Reduced motion

Animation is disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
